WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.491
Sara and Tor ran fast.

2
00:00:13.492 --> 00:00:37.813
Something big was chasing them!

3
00:00:37.814 --> 00:00:41.701
Rex and Sid watched the bugs.

4
00:00:41.702 --> 00:00:45.867
The bugs went into a small hole.

5
00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.978
"Bye, bugs," Sid said.

6
00:00:48.979 --> 00:00:55.890
"Bugs are cool," Rex said.

7
00:00:55.891 --> 00:00:58.754
Rex looked around.

8
00:00:58.755 --> 00:01:06.427
"Where are Sara and Tor?"

9
00:01:06.428 --> 00:01:10.501
Crack! A tree branch snapped.

10
00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:13.596
Something big was coming.

11
00:01:13.597 --> 00:01:16.802
Sid gulped.

12
00:01:16.803 --> 00:01:23.114
Rex opened his jaws wide. "Roar!"

13
00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:26.527
Branches and leaves shook.

14
00:01:26.528 --> 00:01:31.319
But something was still coming.

15
00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:37.113
Rex roared again.

16
00:01:37.114 --> 00:01:42.384
Crunch! Crash!

17
00:01:42.385 --> 00:01:45.883
Something was coming!

18
00:01:45.884 --> 00:01:52.265
It was Tor and Sara!

19
00:01:52.266 --> 00:01:55.155
"Whew!" Tor said.

20
00:01:55.156 --> 00:01:58.361
"We found you!" Sara said.

21
00:01:58.362 --> 00:02:04.203
"Something was chasing us," Tor said.

22
00:02:04.204 --> 00:02:06.481
Sara smiled.

23
00:02:06.482 --> 00:02:15.140
"But you scared it away, Rex!"

24
00:02:15.141 --> 00:02:19.291
Just then Rex pointed. "Look!"

25
00:02:19.292 --> 00:02:23.600
Everyone looked down.

26
00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:26.719
"Eggs!" Sid said.

27
00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:30.761
"It's a nest," Sara said.

28
00:02:30.762 --> 00:02:37.238
Tor grinned. "That's where I got this egg!"

